conversation-thankforhealing-patient-1 = I wanted to thank you for tending to my wounds. I owe you my life.
conversation-thankforhealing-healer-1 = It was my duty. We must look after each other here.
conversation-thankforhealing-patient-2 = The fever has broken, and I can move without such pain.
conversation-thankforhealing-healer-2 = Rest still for a day or two. Let the herbs do their work fully.

conversation-checkonpatient-healer-1 = How are you feeling today? Does the wound trouble you?
conversation-checkonpatient-patient-1 = Much better, thanks to you. The swelling has gone down.
conversation-checkonpatient-healer-2 = Keep the bandage clean and change it when it dampens.
conversation-checkonpatient-patient-2 = I will. Your care has been a blessing.

conversation-smalltalk01-line1-a = Fair weather today, wouldn't you say?
conversation-smalltalk01-line1-b = Aye, a fine day. May it stay this calm till dusk
conversation-smalltalk01-line2-a = Have you heard any news from the nearby villages?
conversation-smalltalk01-line2-b = Only rumors, friend. But rumors keep the world turning

conversation-smalltalk02-line1-a = Greetings. Roads seem quieter than usual
conversation-smalltalk02-line1-b = Quiet roads are a blessing. Means fewer troubles wandering about
conversation-smalltalk02-line2-a = Any advice for a traveler passing through?
conversation-smalltalk02-line2-b = Keep your purse close, your boots dry, and never ignore a warm hearth
conversation-smalltalk02-line3-a = Sounds like wisdom earned the hard way
conversation-smalltalk02-line3-b = In these lands, that's the only way wisdom comes

conversation-greeting-casual-hello = Hello there, friend
conversation-greeting-casual-response = Good day to you! How goes your work?
conversation-greeting-casual-how-are-you = I'm well, thank you. The weather favors us today
conversation-greeting-casual-im-fine = That it does. May your labors be light

conversation-morning-greeting-initiator = Good morning. How did you sleep?
conversation-morning-greeting-responder = Not bad, thank you. Hope the day will be peaceful

